---
import '../../styles/admin.css';
---
<html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex"/><title>Entrar · AleJoias</title></head><body><main class="login-card"><a href="/">← Voltar ao site</a><h1>Painel AleJoias</h1><p>Entre para cuidar do catálogo e dos atendimentos.</p><form id="login"><label>Senha<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required/></label><button>Entrar</button><p id="feedback" role="status"></p></form><p class="hint">Primeiro acesso local: consulte <code>.data/acesso-admin.txt</code> na pasta do projeto. Depois, troque a senha no painel.</p></main><script>document.querySelector('form')?.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const form=e.currentTarget as HTMLFormElement;const feedback=document.querySelector('#feedback')!;try{const response=await fetch('/api/login',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form)))});const data=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw Error(data.error);location.href='/admin';}catch(error){feedback.textContent=(error as Error).message;}});</script></body></html>
